  "solution": "**Given: **(35 P 2) Q 5 S (86 Q 2) R (3 P 15) S 90 = ?\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Letter\n Q\n P\n S\n R\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n –\n \n \n\n(35 P 2) Q 5 S (86 Q 2) R (3 P 15) S 90 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(35 × 2)**__ ÷ 5 +__** (86 ÷ 2)**__ - __**(3 × 15)**__ + 90 = ?\n\n⇒ __**70 ÷ 5**__ + 43 - 45 + 90 = ?\n\n⇒ __**14 + 43**__ - 45 __**+ 90**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 147 - 45 = 102.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\".**",
